{"overview":"این سریال به سبک اکشن و ماجرایی است. نقش اول این داستان «جک باور» در ادارهٔ CTU (واحد ضد تروریستی)، شاخه‌ای خیالی از سازمان CIA (به نظر می‌رسد شاخه‌ای از FBI [ پلیس فدرال امریکا]است)مشغول به کار است(که البته شاخه‌ای شبیه آن با نام دیگر در این سازمان وجود دارد) و هر فصل (Season) یک روز از زندگی او را، در حال مبارزه با یک نقشهٔ تروریستی بزرگ و خطرناک نشان می‌دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Counterterrorism agent Jack Bauer fights the bad guys of the world, a day at a time. With each week's episode unfolding in real-time, \"24\" covers a single day in the life of Bauer each season.","tagline_en":"A lot can happen in a day.","runtime":45,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":17,"y":2004,"poster":"/8AMYBuu2cfLadwvExmq5iftCpXb.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2001,"poster":"/gYbW4kqZFO8SQlgdYeVnnRQNJ6L.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2002,"poster":"/waK2AidxJTsKv7xS0NtJGL1chx6.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":2003,"poster":"/zd1FcyL46thHHXmpu8XhutIBj77.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":2005,"poster":"/i72TwDKYNqmpFx4xAtSLw8mHTmk.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":24,"y":2006,"poster":"/19QTv89HyyhbcNg1rNRB2CQjkWW.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":24,"y":2007,"poster":"/bl5iHILVsyVBoRWGo8oTIB5lwRy.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":24,"y":2009,"poster":"/pfpS5G6KWwCrr7ZQzCqgfB41w0u.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":24,"y":2010,"poster":"/mSA0FD1qeagllDYK5cDXMTSttB8.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":12,"y":2014,"poster":"/AhHP7AMWmWcRPtAezwAt46nQZTE.jpg"}],"episodes":204,"crew":["Robert Cochran","Joel Surnow"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کیفر ساترلند","role":"Jack Bauer","photo":"/tK5zjdvao2NELns3bqT7PPqPeJI.jpg","en":"Kiefer Sutherland"},{"name":"Mary Lynn Rajskub","role":"Chloe O'Brian","photo":"/oi94VPrp5Ur0nkIqyk6jRu8Eayz.jpg"},{"name":"Kim Raver","role":"Audrey Raines","photo":"/o9OYkG0b48125tim78ebyGeC4lO.jpg"},{"name":"ایوان استراهاوسکی","role":"Kate Morgan","photo":"/2IQEjn5T8urx6ikXM87QGs5M